                "text": "\ud83d\udea8ATTN #CA44 Veterans!\n\n@DeptVetAffairs has announced an expansion of VA benefits under the PACT Act, which helps Veterans exposed to toxic substances during their service.\n\nIn addition to treatment for toxic exposure, Veterans can now qualify for breast cancer risk assessments, mammograms, and other forms of preventative care regardless of age.\n\nFind out more about your benefits at:\u00a0https://t.co/WCvZ3T6t5s",
