                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Cancer is not a one size fits all diagnosis. It is an aggressive disease that impacts millions of Americans and their families each year \u2013 including mine. \n\nUnfortunately, communities of color are disproportionately impacted by late-stage diagnosis & see higher rates of mortality from cancer.\n\u00a0\nThis #WorldCancerDay, we raise awareness & encourage the prevention, early detection, & treatment\u00a0of the disease.",
