                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Most rare diseases don\u2019t have an FDA-approved treatment & children are disproportionately represented among the rare disease patient population.\n\nProud to join my colleagues to reauthorize the critical Creating Hope Act & ensure children have access to innovative FDA-approved treatments.",
