                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "There is a close connection between oral health & diabetes. Diagnosis & treatment of dental infections has proven effective in successful care for patients with diabetes.\n\u00a0\nProud to join @RepCohen &\u00a0@RepLloydDoggett to lead 37 colleagues on a letter to @CMSgov Administrator\u00a0@BrooksLaSureCMS to support dental coverage for Medicare enrollees with diabetes.",
