                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over 300 million people are affected by a Rare Disease worldwide. Children make up nearly half of those living with rare diseases,\u00a0yet children's treatment options are extremely limited.\n\u00a0\nProud to co-lead the Creating Hope Reauthorization Act, which will help with the development of new drugs for children with rare pediatric diseases.\n\u00a0\nOn World Rare Disease Day, we raise awareness & continue our support for those affected.",
