                "text": "In #SouthGate this morning to present nearly $1 MILLION in funding I secured for clean drinking water! \n\nFunding will support the development of new treatment facilities to remove PFAS and other contaminants from two shuttered water wells in the city. Once remediated, the wells will provide a new supply of safe drinking water for local residents.\n\nThank you South Gate Mayor Hurtado and the @SouthGateCAgov for partnering with me on this critical project in #CA44.",
