                "text": "A 4-year-old girl in Bakersfield was allowed into the U.S. legally for emergency medical treatment. Now, the Trump Administration has\u00a0revoked her humanitarian status.\n\nDoctors say she could die within days if she\u2019s deported & loses access to care. This child is not a threat and we should provide her the life-saving care she needs.\n\nI joined my colleagues in demanding DHS\u00a0reverse this cruel and senseless decision. @HouseDemocrats will continue to stand up for the vulnerable. \n\nhttps://t.co/X5RGTuDNlW",
